      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also, no I'm not going to just learn udon and figure out how to make a new world that reloads the artwork as well as has working boards to draw on that sync up right. I work 40hr weeks, don't have time for that. Just sucks my friend group who always went there just got VRC+ and they break our favorite world for over a month now.",
