      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The Presentation room im pretty sure relies on scripts to function. Being a World made by staff they where able to upload worlds with scripts included.\nThe update to il2pcc broke most of these worlds as you cant load mono script in from asset bundles anymore. so only scripts inside the game itself already will work.\nThat's probably the reason the map is now breaking/broken. \nSadly only way to fix this would be to remake the map with udon (if possible) or a vrchat staff member to remake the map /reintroduce the required scripts into the game itself for it to function.\nThe latter being unrealistic.\nThis is also the reason \"The HUB\" is now gone (cross platform hub is only one avaible) \naswell as all the old game worlds",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
