  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The boards in the presentation room won't allow you to draw directly on them anymore.\nMy friends and I have been coming here for years... Miss it. Been over a month now since it's been broken.\nSide note... Why is it that the presentation room is literally the only art world that loads in the art when you join late or rejoin? I wish that was more publicly available so that can be featured in other worlds. Same with the ability to draw directly on boards.... Qv lens are great but it sucks when you have to reload all the art won't load back in.",
